{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev80304","label":"OVER ZONE · Part 2"},"label":"Steel That Kills, Steel That Saves: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_overzone2_03_s","next":"event_overzone2_intermission_01","speakers":{"dorothy":"Dorothy","hongryeon":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_1","text":"*Gwak*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02","bgArt":"desert_02","image":null,"bgm":"ambient_scn_wind","movie":null,"shown":["dorothy","hongryeon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_2","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_2","text":"*Kaboom*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_3","text":"... Amazing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_4","text":"Hath the battle truly ended with such haste? They kept talking about how many were here, so I got my hopes up. I must confess they are dashed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_5","text":"Is it just me, or have you seemed inordinately strong lately? More so than usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_6","text":"What do you think is different?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_7","text":"Perhaps it is because I am cheating, haha.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_8","text":"Cheating?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_9","text":"Haha, come on, be serious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_10","text":"Let's see, it has been... 5 years? For 5 long years, I have done battle with creatures most foul.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_satellitespiano","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_11","text":"In the beginning, these skirmishes merely consisted of prototype Nikkes against prototype Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_12","text":"However, they both evolved in the blink of an eye.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_13","text":"Both were enhanced in order to more effectively kill the other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_14","text":"The most obvious byproduct of this evolution for Nikkes was their ability to use firearms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["product12","product08"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_15","text":"Whereas the Raptures became more capable of snuffing out these gun-toting Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_16","text":"Yet, train thine eyes upon mine visage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02","bgArt":"desert_02","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_17","text":"Scarlet slashes her sword through the air.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_18","text":"I wield this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_19","text":"I see. So you're saying this is far from the norm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_20","text":"Precisely. Those creatures shant ever evolve enough to send me across the River Styx.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_21","text":"For all of them to evolve simply to take down a single Nikke who wields a blade would be worth neither the time nor effort.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_22","text":"As for me, however, I am evolving.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_23","text":"I am becoming more adept at rendering Raptures asunder with this sword.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_24","text":"Those beasts are stuck treading water, whereas I am darting through it like a torpedo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_25","text":"That is why I am so strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_26","text":"The Raptures must be keeping an eye out for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_27","text":"Haha, I am but one lone swordsman. How could I contribute to this war?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_28","text":"Don't say that. You're...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_29","text":"It's about flipping that thought around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_30","text":"One day, I shall draw this blade across the Queen's throat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_31","text":"That is, if her life is not taken first by someone neither of us knows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_32","text":"The mere thought makes mine body quiver with joy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_33","text":"That makes two of us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_35","text":"What will you do after?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_36","text":"I am unsure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_37","text":"I was born to fight, so my destiny shall be to wield this blade until my dying day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_38","text":"To do what one does best until one shuffles off this mortal coil... surely such a life is not so bad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_39","text":"Perhaps, but I think I can speak for the others as well, in that we hope you can have another goal in life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_40","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_41","text":"Well, there is something I've thought about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_42","text":"What's that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_43","text":"Crafting my own alcoholic spirits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_45","text":"Don't look at me like I'm some lush worthy of pity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_46","text":"But you are a lush.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_48","text":"Do you remember the seeds I threw aside a few days ago? The ones that ended up sprouting?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_49","text":"Yes. I remember.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_50","text":"To see new life blooming in the midst of this harsh wasteland was a most shocking revelation to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_51","text":"There has been much devastation, yet life still breathes within this land. I had forgotten that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_52","text":"Although civilization has collapsed and humanity has disappeared, the land itself is still teeming with life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_53","text":"I know not if we should consider Raptures as a form of life, but all we have done is slaughter them indiscriminately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_54","text":"Instead of ending life, I want to create it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_55","text":"That is why I have chosen to become a farmer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_56","text":"A farmer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_57","text":"Yes, a farmer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_58","text":"I want to witness new life being born.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_59","text":"I want to see it with my own two eyes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_60","text":"Then turn it into booze.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_61","text":"Right, right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_62","text":"Haha. Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_63","text":"An existence filled with death and destruction is no life at all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_64","text":"So, I...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_65","text":"We can start with a small garden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_66","text":"Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_67","text":"Let's make a small garden at the temporary guard post. It's not much, but it'll be a start.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_68","text":"A fine proposition indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone2_03_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone2_03_e_69","text":"We'll start straight away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}